{*
	Every tag, filter, function and variable here is defined in the settings of
	this project, not by Latte. Nothing in this file may be underlined.

	The definitions live in .idea/latte.xml, which the build writes before the
	sandbox IDE starts, so there is nothing to fill in by hand. To see them, open
	Settings | Languages & Frameworks | Latte and look at the four pages below it.

	Two things worth trying once the file is quiet:

	  - type {ic and {$title|exc and n:too and see each one offered;
	  - switch "Enable Custom Tags" off, press OK, and watch {panel} and {icon}
	    turn into errors without the file being touched. Switch it back on and
	    they go quiet again.
*}
<h1>{$siteName}</h1>

{panel 'Latest'}
	<ul>
		<li n:foreach="[1, 2, 3] as $id">
			{icon 'chevron'}
			<span n:tooltip="'Article number ' . $id">{$id|excerpt:80}</span>
		</li>
	</ul>
{/panel}

<p>{formatPrice(1290)}</p>

{icon 'star'|upper}
